  "acceptance": [
    "Every residue path gets exactly one disposition, decided by existing tooling (`atm tasks status --residue`, `atm tasks realign-plan-source --map ... --dry-run`, the residue-cleanup workflow, or the per-task claim/release/commit ledger pattern): commit with its owning task, quarantine outside the repo with SHA-256 and a recovery path, or tool-classified transient removal.",
