    "No file outside `scopePaths` changes; no source, test, release, dist, or planning-card edit.",
    "`git status --porcelain -- .atm packages/cli/.atm` is empty, or the remaining paths are listed with owner and reason.",
    "No new command, tracker, dashboard, or evidence family is introduced.",
    "Stop rule: 45 minutes from claim. At the limit, record the remaining count and stop instead of extending the card. Do not hand-edit ledger records or hand-delete runtime locks.",
    "Commits touching `.atm` are serialized with product commits; do not commit while another actor has staged entries in the shared index."
  ],
